    {
      "end" : 295.0799865722656,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 294.8599853515625,
      "text" : "Yes."
    },
    {
      "end" : 297.3399963378906,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 295.3199768066406,
      "text" : "Is it something that there's enough money for it?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 301.47998046875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 297.44000244140625,
      "text" : "It's something that's happening in every city all over the world, that there are cameras"
    },
    {
      "end" : 302.55999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 301.6999816894531,
      "text" : "all over the place."
    },
    {
      "end" : 303,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 302.8599853515625,
      "text" : "Absolutely."
    },
    {
      "end" : 306.7799987792969,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 303.239990234375,
      "text" : "So, what's just another few cameras if it's helping us be safe?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 307.0199890136719,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 306.8799743652344,
      "text" : "Absolutely,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 307.6199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 307.05999755859375,
      "text" : "being safe."
    },
    {
      "end" : 308.2200012207031,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 307.739990234375,
      "text" : "It's a bit of a"
    },
    {
      "end" : 308.5799865722656,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 308.2200012207031,
      "text" : "paradox."
    },
    {
      "end" : 314.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 308.7799987792969,
      "text" : "We have a relatively low-tech means of transportation that's relatively good for the environment,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 320.2599792480469,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 315.2200012207031,
      "text" : "and yet what you're proposing is more and more and more surveillance, personal surveillance,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 321.91998291015625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 320.41998291015625,
      "text" : "in order to use this thing."
    },
    {
      "end" : 324,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 322.239990234375,
      "text" : "Because people are not..."
    },
    {
      "end" : 348.4000244140625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 342.7200012207031,
      "text" : "that the public things are not there."
    },
    {
      "end" : 349.8600158691406,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 348.82000732421875,
      "text" : "- You always need a backup."
    },
    {
      "end" : 351.6600036621094,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 350.2200012207031,
      "text" : "If the camera goes out,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 355.08001708984375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 351.95001220703125,
      "text" : "if you wanna have a couple of views"
    },
    {
      "end" : 357.7400207519531,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 355.44000244140625,
      "text" : "of some kind of accident that might have occurred,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 359.3800048828125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 358.46002197265625,
      "text" : "so this way--"
    },
    {
      "end" : 360.05999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 359.4000244140625,
      "text" : "- Do you think cops"
    },
    {
      "end" : 360.9800109863281,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 360.05999755859375,
      "text" : "could give them tickets"
    },
    {
      "end" : 363.3800048828125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 361.6800231933594,
      "text" : "for people on bikes that don't follow the law?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 363.96002197265625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 363.82000732421875,
      "text" : "'Cause"
    },
    {
      "end" : 365.08001708984375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 363.96002197265625,
      "text" : "right now I don't think that's a thing."
    },
    {
      "end" : 367.7200012207031,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 365.3000183105469,
      "text" : "- If they had access to UAV video, sure."
    },
    {
      "end" : 369.6600036621094,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 368.6199951171875,
      "text" : "I would think so."
    },
    {
      "end" : 369.9200134277344,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 369.67999267578125,
      "text" : "Okay."
    },
    {
      "end" : 370.5400085449219,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 370.1499938964844,
      "text" : "I don't know."
    },
    {
      "end" : 371.1199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 370.7699890136719,
      "text" : "Could be."
    },
    {
      "end" : 400.6199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 400.32000732421875,
      "text" : "Okay."
    }
  ],
